{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121652","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121652/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121652/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121652/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121652","id":4952430006,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJzAVtg","number":121652,"title":"[C#] Overriding script type of instanced scene's internal child will result in \"ghost\" object being assigned to associated `Export` field of instanced scene","user":{"login":"Saalvage","id":29021710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MDIxNzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29021710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage","html_url":"https://github.com/Saalvage","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-07-22T19:25:56Z","updated_at":"2026-07-23T13:04:32Z","closed_at":"2026-07-23T13:01:57Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nFrom at least 4.4 (earlier not tested) to 4.8-dev2.\nThe issue appears to be exclusive to C#, I could not reproduce it using GDScript.\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10\n\n### Issue description\n\nFollowing the setup described in the reproduction steps, the exported field of the instanced scene will hold a reference to a disposed instance of the base class instead of the actual child, which is of the derived class.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create two empty script types, `Base` and `Derived`, with `Derived` inheriting from `Base`.\n2. Create a scene, which has a node with the `Base` script as a child, and has a script with an `Export`ed `Base` field, to which the child is assigned.\n3. Instantiate the scene and replace the `Base` script with `Derived` on the instantiated scene's child via `Editable Children`.\n4. Now, attempting to access the `Base` field within the scene's script will yield a disposed instance of `Base`, instead of the expected instance of `Derived`.\n\nNote, that the actual `Derived` child exists and can be accessed via `GetNode` normally, it's just the `Export`ed field that is assigned an invalid object.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[broken-exported-derived-child-in-instantiated-scene.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30281343/broken-exported-derived-child-in-instantiated-scene.zip) (run \"BrokenTestScene.tscn\")","closed_by":{"login":"Saalvage","id":29021710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MDIxNzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29021710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage","html_url":"https://github.com/Saalvage","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saalvage/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121652/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121652/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}